# Conjugate base shifts a buffer's pH
register lv2
add v1 water 400mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.004mol
add v1 NaOAc 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 400mL
add v2 CH3COOH 0.004mol
add v2 NaOAc 0.002mol
measure v2 ph
new
add v3 water 400mL
add v3 CH3COOH 0.004mol
add v3 NaOAc 0.004mol
measure v3 ph
new
add v4 water 400mL
add v4 CH3COOH 0.004mol
add v4 NaOAc 0.008mol
measure v4 ph
# Computed aqueous activities omit probe and preparation uncertainty.
